{
 "purpose": "clientResolver.addr over every shape a proxy or a client can send. want is the address counted (empty: the request is not counted). warn is the one once-only warning the request raises on a fresh resolver ('untrusted': a header from a peer not in HBAND_TRUSTED_PROXIES; 'no-entry': a trusted peer forwarded no client entry; 'internal': the client resolved to an internal address). trusted defaults to [127.0.0.1]. The class is bounded by who produces its members: the operator's proxy configuration and the client's own headers. Not bounded: a proxy that rewrites an address into something that parses as another visitor's.",
